      "text": "Lima – Iquitos – Heliconia Amazon River Lodge"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:2e780f63f4172747",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "4b27335603181e50e2ede43e0439e048cf63e1a666f9f63c567d85cf22d96260",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-mw9trov9-0oxzxedywb",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      },
      "text": "After breakfast, transfer to the airport for your flight to Iquitos. On arrival, you will be met and taken to the port.\n\nBoard a speedboat for the journey along the Amazon towards the Yanamono jungle. The ride offers views of the river and tropical forest.\n\nAt Heliconia Amazon River Lodge, you are welcomed with a cocktail made with local tropical fruits. After settling in, set out on a jungle walk, where you may see exotic plants, old tropical trees and local wildlife.\n\nTowards evening, watch the sunset. Return to the lodge for dinner and time to relax. Later, local guides share stories and legends of the Amazon."
    },
